\title{DegradSim: simulation of Lévy and non-homogeneous Lévy degradation processes}
\description{
\code{DegradSim} simulates exactly, at given inspection times, one or several
degradation trajectories of two families of processes:
\enumerate{
\item \strong{Lévy processes} (homogeneous case): gamma, Wiener, inverse Gaussian,
variance-gamma and Meixner processes;
\item \strong{non-homogeneous Lévy processes} obtained by a time change
\eqn{X_t = Y_{A(t)}} of a Lévy process \eqn{Y}: gamma, Wiener and
inverse Gaussian processes.
}
}
\details{
The inspection times can be irregular and differ from one trajectory to
